<title>LEBANON: SOLIDERE shares rise on Beirut Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>SOLIDERE shares rise on Beirut Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOLIDERE shares rose on Thursday on the Beirut Stock exchange (BSE).</p>
<p>A shares rose fractionally to $111.125 from Wednesday's $111 and B shares rose to $114 from $113.125.</p>
<p>Turnover fell slightly to 4,175 shares from 4,420 on Wednesday and value was $468,112.125 from $492,795.5.</p>
<p>There was no trade for the fourth consecutive day this week in the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index was up 0.13 percent to 83.89 and the BLOM stock index went up 0.37 percent to 962.17</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
